ubseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9CompactnessSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\in V\\)</span> is a set-valued syntax operation.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sent}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Sent}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_\\Sigma\">\\(\\models_\\Sigma\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"58-df-logic\">58-df-logic</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9CompactnessSpectrum}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9CompactnessSpectrum}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}compactness\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9CompactnessSpectrum}_S(\\Sigma,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma))\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P(\\Gamma)\\;\n(|\\Delta|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\exists\\mathcal M\\in V\\;(\\mathcal M\\models_\\Sigma\\Delta))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{119pt}\\to\\exists\\mathcal M\\in V\\;(\\mathcal M\\models_\\Sigma\\Gamma)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}compactness\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9CompactnessSpectrum}_S(\\Sigma,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma))\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P(\\Gamma)\\;\n(|\\Delta|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\exists\\mathcal M\\in V\\;(\\mathcal M\\models_\\Sigma\\Delta))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{119pt}\\to\\exists\\mathcal M\\in V\\;(\\mathcal M\\models_\\Sigma\\Gamma)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Membership in the compactness spectrum is a predicate on an infinite cardinal, avoiding an unbounded class comprehension.  Sentence collections and their small subcollections are explicitly set-bounded, while each model witness is a set-coded structure.</li>\n<li>此处的“紧致性”是语义可满足性的局部—整体性质，不依赖拓扑紧致性谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"44e32f3fb4334e0c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"44e32f